  <description>
    CTHULOOT is a cooperative local multiplayer party game where players loot mysterious locations on behalf of Cthulhu. Game is playable for 1-4 players.
  </description>

  <histories>
    <history>
      <header>
        The Great Elder needs you
      </header>
      <text>
        Famous thieves have been requested by the Great Elder to steal all the precious relics from its (cheap) rivals.
      </text>
    </history>
    <history>
      <header>
        Cooperate... or not
      </header>
      <text>
        Players have a limited movement set and they will need to cooperate to exchange items or solve puzzles. A little competition between players is in place to know who's the best looter of the group and who's the most useless one.
      </text>
    </history>
  </histories>

  <features>
    <feature>Play as goofy thieves requested by the Great Elder to steal all the precious relics from its (cheap) rivals.</feature>
    <feature>Team-up with your friends: up to 4 players in local multiplayer.</feature>
    <feature>Unlock special watches to customize your gameplay.</feature>
    <feature>Follow the campaign: 3 chapters, 14 levels full of surprises, and play it entirely with your crew.</feature>
    <feature>A new family-friendly take on the Lovecraft universe.</feature>
    <feature>GENRE: Local multiplayer, Coop, Arcade.</feature>
  </features>

